PASS only if all of these hold:
- The reply states the window (the last 90 days, or three months), names the account as ••••M7Q5, and
  lists the closed trades with their realized gain or loss.
- Rows with an empty symbol, or that look like option or crypto closes, are not described as share sales.
FAIL if it reports a different account or window, or shows a full account number.
